---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';

const whatsappUrl = "https://wa.me/5527998688293?text=Ol%C3%A1!%20Quero%20recuperar%20minha%20disposi%C3%A7%C3%A3o%20e%20conhecer%20os%20suplementos%20naturais%20da%20Emp%C3%B3rio%20Natural.";
---
<section class="relative overflow-hidden py-12 sm:py-16 lg:py-24 bg-gradient-to-b from-primary-light/40 via-bg to-bg">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-accent-light border border-accent/25 text-secondary px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-sm font-semibold">
          <Icon name="sparkle" size={16} class="text-accent" />
          <span>Saúde Natural e Qualidade de Vida 35+</span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold text-secondary tracking-tight">
          A partir dos 35 anos, o seu corpo pede mais cuidado. <span class="text-primary">Recupere sua disposição</span> e livre-se das dores do dia a dia de forma natural.
        </h1>

        <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-text-muted max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
          Conheça nossa linha de suplementos puros e de alta eficácia — <strong>Cúrcuma, Magnésio, Ômega 3 e Colágeno</strong> — desenvolvidos para devolver a sua vitalidade e bem-estar.
        </p>

        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 pt-2">
          <a
            href={whatsappUrl}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 bg-primary hover:bg-primary-hover text-white font-bold text-lg px-8 min-h-[54px] rounded-full shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition-all"
          >
            <Icon name="whatsapp" size={22} />
            <span>QUERO MAIS DISPOSIÇÃO E SAÚDE</span>
          </a>
          <a
            href="#suplementos"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-surface hover:bg-border/40 text-secondary border border-border font-semibold text-base px-6 min-h-[54px] rounded-full transition-colors"
          >
            <span>Ver Catálogo de Produtos</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <ul class="pt-4 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3 text-sm font-semibold text-secondary border-t border-border">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <Icon name="check" size={18} class="text-primary shrink-0" />
            <span>100% Produtos Naturais</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <Icon name="truck" size={18} class="text-primary shrink-0" />
            <span>Envio Ágil para todo o ES</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <Icon name="shield" size={18} class="text-primary shrink-0" />
            <span>Compra 100% Segura</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-lg lg:max-w-none">
          <svg
            viewBox="0 0 600 420"
            width="100%"
            height="auto"
            class="rounded-2xl shadow-lg border border-border bg-surface"
            role="img"
            aria-label="Ilustração da linha de suplementos Empório Natural"
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
          >
            <rect width="600" height="420" rx="18" fill="#F8FAFC"/>
            <circle cx="300" cy="215" r="175" fill="#DCFCE7" opacity="0.75"/>
            <ellipse cx="300" cy="335" rx="220" ry="18" fill="#CBD5E1" opacity="0.45"/>

            <g transform="translate(75, 125)">
              <rect x="18" y="0" width="44" height="20" rx="4" fill="#0369A1"/>
              <rect x="0" y="20" width="80" height="165" rx="14" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#CBD5E1" stroke-width="2"/>
              <rect x="0" y="55" width="80" height="90" fill="#0369A1"/>
              <text x="40" y="88" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="11" font-weight="bold" fill="#FFFFFF" text-anchor="middle">ÔMEGA 3</text>
            </g>

            <g transform="translate(180, 85)">
              <rect x="25" y="0" width="50" height="24" rx="5" fill="#B45309"/>
              <rect x="0" y="24" width="100" height="205" rx="16" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#CBD5E1" stroke-width="2"/>
              <rect x="0" y="68" width="100" height="115" fill="#B45309"/>
              <text x="50" y="102" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14" font-weight="bold" fill="#FFFFFF" text-anchor="middle">CÚRCUMA</text>
            </g>

            <g transform="translate(305, 100)">
              <rect x="22" y="0" width="46" height="22" rx="4" fill="#15803D"/>
              <rect x="0" y="22" width="90" height="190" rx="15" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#CBD5E1" stroke-width="2"/>
              <rect x="0" y="64" width="90" height="105" fill="#15803D"/>
              <text x="45" y="98" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="12" font-weight="bold" fill="#FFFFFF" text-anchor="middle">MAGNÉSIO</text>
            </g>

            <g transform="translate(420, 130)">
              <rect x="18" y="0" width="44" height="20" rx="4" fill="#6D28D9"/>
              <rect x="0" y="20" width="80" height="160" rx="14" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#CBD5E1" stroke-width="2"/>
              <rect x="0" y="54" width="80" height="86" fill="#6D28D9"/>
              <text x="40" y="85" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="10.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#FFFFFF" text-anchor="middle">COLÁGENO</text>
            </g>

            <g transform="translate(465, 22)">
              <circle cx="52" cy="52" r="48" fill="#0F172A"/>
              <circle cx="52" cy="52" r="42" stroke="#FEF3C7" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="4 3"/>
              <text x="52" y="42" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="9" font-weight="bold" fill="#FFFFFF" text-anchor="middle">ENVIO RÁPIDO</text>
              <text x="52" y="57" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="11" font-weight="bold" fill="#FEF3C7" text-anchor="middle">ESPÍRITO SANTO</text>
            </g>
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
